  "slug": "mombasa-pumpkin-dessert",
  "name": "Mombasa Pumpkin Dessert",
  "recipe_type": "dessert",
  "brief_description": "This dessert's coconut and creamy taste is irresistible! For the weight watchers this could be too much! You can add more sugar to this dish, according to your taste.",
  "cuisine": "East African",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Steam the pumpkin pieces for 5 to 10 minutes. Scoop flesh from skins."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "In a medium saucepan, combine the pumpkin flesh and sugar. Heat over medium-low temperature until sugar dissolves into the pumpkin. Add coconut and cardamom. Stir often. Cook until the mixture has thickened to thick pudding-like consistency."
    }
  ],
